            <ArticleTitle>Giant pseudoaneurysm from Vieussens' arterial ring.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1833-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A giant coronary pseudoaneurysm of uncertain cause, arising from Vieussens' arterial ring, was preoperatively diagnosed in an oligosymptomatic female patient. Successful off-pump surgical excision without additional bypass grafting was performed. Difficulties in diagnostic algorithm, as well as possible cause and extremely rare localization were discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
